#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:4
msgid "Personalized Federated Learning Algorithms"
msgstr "个性化联邦学习算法"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:6
msgid ""
"In personalized federated learning (PFL), each client seeks a model "
"tailored to its own data distribution while still benefiting from the "
"knowledge of the other clients. A simple and general way to formulate PFL"
" is via *weak consensus*: instead of enforcing full consensus "
":math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots = \\theta_K`, one adds a regularizer "
":math:`\\mathcal{R}` that penalizes the deviation between the local "
"models. This page collects the PFL algorithms (implemented in ``fl_sim`` "
"or closely related) together with their pseudocodes."
msgstr ""
"在个性化联邦学习（Personalized Federated Learning, PFL）中，每个客户端都希望得到适配自身"
"数据分布的模型，同时又能利用其他客户端的知识。表述 PFL 的一种简单而通用的方式是*弱共识*"
"（weak consensus）：不强制完全共识 :math:`\\theta_1 = \\cdots = \\theta_K`，而是添加一个惩罚"
"局部模型之间偏差的正则项 :math:`\\mathcal{R}`。本页收集了（在 ``fl_sim`` 中实现的或与之密切"
"相关的）PFL 算法及其伪代码。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:16
msgid "``L2SGD``: Loopless Local SGD"
msgstr "``L2SGD``：无环局部随机梯度下降"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:18
msgid ""
"The simplest algorithm of this family is the loopless stochastic gradient"
" descent (Loopless Local SGD, ``L2SGD``) introduced in "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`]. It considers the following weak-"
"consensus problem"
msgstr ""
"这一族算法中最简单的是 [:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 提出的无环随机梯度下降"
"（Loopless Local SGD，``L2SGD``）。它考虑如下弱共识问题"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:22
msgid ""
"\\begin{array}{cl}\n"
"\\minimize & F(\\Theta) = f(\\Theta) + \\lambda \\varphi(\\Theta) \\\\\n"
"\\text{where} & f(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K "
"f_k(\\theta_k), \\\\\n"
"& \\varphi(\\Theta) = \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert "
"\\theta_k - \\bar{\\theta} \\right\\rVert^2\n"
"= \\frac{1}{2K} \\sum\\limits_{k=1}^K \\left\\lVert \\theta_k - "
"\\frac{1}{K} \\sum\\limits_{j=1}^K \\theta_j \\right\\rVert^2, \\\\\n"
"& \\Theta = \\col(\\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K),\n"
"\\end{array}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:33
msgid ""
"where :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` is the penalty coefficient and "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta} = \\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` is the "
"global average model. For :math:`0 < \\lambda < \\infty`, the solution "
":math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` is called a set of "
"*mixed models*. It is easy to see that this problem is equivalent to the "
"problem considered by ``FedProx`` (cf. the constrained problem in the "
":ref:`proximal algorithms section <fl_alg_proximal>`)."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\lambda \\geqslant 0` 为罚参数，:math:`\\bar{\\theta} = "
"\\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\theta_k` 为全局平均模型。当 :math:`0 < \\lambda "
"< \\infty` 时，解 :math:`\\bar{\\theta}, \\theta_1, \\ldots, \\theta_K` 被"
"称作一组*混合模型*（mixed models）。容易看出，上述问题与 :ref:`临近算法一节 "
"<fl_alg_proximal>` 中 ``FedProx`` 所考察的问题等价。"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:40
msgid ""
"Instead of evaluating the full gradient :math:`\\nabla F = \\nabla f + "
"\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi` at every iteration, "
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] defines an unbiased stochastic "
"gradient of :math:`F`"
msgstr ""
"[:footcite:ct:`hanzely2020federated`] 没有在每次迭代都计算完整的梯度 "
":math:`\\nabla F = \\nabla f + \\lambda \\nabla \\varphi`，而是为 :math:`F` "
"定义了如下无偏随机梯度"

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:44
msgid ""
"G(\\Theta) := \\begin{cases}\n"
"\\frac{\\nabla f(\\Theta)}{1 - p}, & \\text{with probability } 1 - p, "
"\\\\\n"
"\\frac{\\lambda \\nabla \\varphi(\\Theta)}{p}, & \\text{with probability "
"} p,\n"
"\\end{cases}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/algorithms/pfl.rst:52
msgid ""
"with :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`. Note that computing :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta)"
" = \\col(\\nabla f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` is "
"completely block-separable: in the federated setting, this step is "
"carried out locally on the clients without any communication with the "
"server, which is a significant advantage in communication-constrained "
"scenarios. In this sense, ``L2SGD`` already incorporates the *loopless* "
"(skipping) idea; cf. the ``ProxSkip`` algorithm in the :ref:`skipping "
"algorithms section <fl_alg_skipping>`. Under the additional finite-sum "
"assumption :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)`, one"
" can further combine the stochastic gradient with randomized Kaczmarz-"
"type (importance-sampled) updates; see "
"[:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`] for the analysis of loopless "
"methods. The resulting method is summarized below."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`p \\in (0, 1)`。注意，计算 :math:`\\nabla f(\\Theta) = "
"\\col(\\nabla f_1(\\theta_1), \\ldots, \\nabla f_K(\\theta_K))` 是完全块分离"
"的：在联邦学习的场景下，这一步只需在客户端本地完成，不涉及与服务器的任何通信，"
"这对以通信为主要瓶颈的联邦学习是巨大的优势。从这个意义上说，``L2SGD`` 已经融入"
"了*无环*（跳步）的思想；参见 :ref:`跳步算法一节 <fl_alg_skipping>` 中的 "
"``ProxSkip``。在额外的有限和假设 :math:`f_k(\\theta_k) = \\sum_{j=1}^m "
"f_{k,j}(\\theta_k)` 下，还可以进一步把该随机梯度与随机 Kaczmarz 型（重要性采样）"
"更新结合起来；关于无环方法的分析参见 [:footcite:ct:`Kovalev2020_loopless`]。"
"由此得到的算法总结如下。"

